_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x2VuHzUknYoQ7kNvwHSqQFB&_nc_oc=AdrFQJtipBVPoobwBiX1L1KFrG33zAKDtF1_e4tkTIk1w_lsN-Bm9EjiQl1nOFWCUvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSKv3YQpvcSnc1qo8F8C2esUhMD4V0mqpBW1oo02cqkBw&oe=6AFC869E"}, "display_name": "Bowmaster", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dust off your dual bow skills in Early Access, while supporting the accelerated development of the next release! \n\nAll for half the cost of a single-meat burrito. \n\nBowmaster is a timeless skill game that disappeared during the ice age. 4Play Games has been tasked with its restoration. \n\n---\n\nI play this version with headphones in, tracking my average targets-per-second. \n\nWe need pre-release revenue and you might could use some pre-release training. Win-win?\n\nEarly access players will receive an exclusive in-game reward related to the belt you earn. \n\nThis version of the game will get bug fixes, a few more patterns, and maybe a couple extras. Eventually it will be scrapped like formwork to reveal a concrete structure called Bowmaster V2 (construction metaphor)\n\nSome of that might sound redundant if you read the short description first...\n\nthanks 4 playing", "short_description": "Dust off your dual bow skills in Early Access, while supporting the accelerated development of the next release! \n\nAll for half the cost of a single-meat burrito.\n\nBowmaster is a timeless skill game that disappeared during the ice age. 4Play Games has been tasked with its restoration.\n\nWe need pre-release revenue and you might could use some pre-release training. Win-win?\n\nThe black belt is probably overkill..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/sum-uno/Bowmaster/blob/main/Privacy%20Policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "n/a", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://github.com/sum-uno/Bowmaster", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null